{"3027740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Escape From Benjamin's Room", "steam_appid": 3027740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027740/extras/f8439cefebe6c17082139dd2a2d12439.avif?t=1785485073\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027740/extras_big/f8439cefebe6c17082139dd2a2d12439.avif?t=1785485073 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape From Benjamin's Room</strong> is a unique 2D puzzle adventure that will put your brain to work. You play as a stranger trapped in an old scientist's room who has lost his wife and wants to bring her back to life.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think outside the box to solve all the puzzles in the room, click on any game objects to interact, and pay attention to the details </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027740/extras/6962a5acad46e806a7a413e0bdae482d.avif?t=1785485073\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027740/extras_big/6962a5acad46e806a7a413e0bdae482d.avif?t=1785485073 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your headphones to get immersed in this incredible escape room game. You'll enjoy this adventure to the fullest! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027740/extras/c72f58e47750c1434a2fd16bbc0bec36.avif?t=1785485073\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027740/extras_big/c72f58e47750c1434a2fd16bbc0bec36.avif?t=1785485073 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides the original Benjamin's room, you can play an Alternative room that has the same furniture, but different enigmas from the original room   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027740/extras/7310949fd07e108a11f7821ae2e101b2.avif?t=1785485073\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027740/extras_big/7310949fd07e108a11f7821ae2e101b2.avif?t=1785485073 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy solving logic problems and playing adventures like escape rooms or puzzle games, you will enjoy this adventure and put your brain to work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027740/extras/c3f8b875cef2187608d4ad4f750bfcb5.avif?t=1785485073\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027740/extras_big/c3f8b875cef2187608d4ad4f750bfcb5.avif?t=1785485073 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get stuck on solving <i>a</i> riddle, click the bulb button to get a hint that will help you solve the current enigma and escape the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027740/extras/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785485073\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027740/extras_big/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785485073 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027740/extras/f8439cefebe6c17082139dd2a2d12439.avif?t=1785485073\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027740/extras_big/f8439cefebe6c17082139dd2a2d12439.avif?t=1785485073 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape From Benjamin's Room</strong> is a unique 2D puzzle adventure that will put your brain to work. You play as a stranger trapped in an old scientist's room who has lost his wife and wants to bring her back to life.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think outside the box to solve all the puzzles in the room, click on any game objects to interact, and pay attention to the details </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027740/extras/6962a5acad46e806a7a413e0bdae482d.avif?t=1785485073\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027740/extras_big/6962a5acad46e806a7a413e0bdae482d.avif?t=1785485073 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your headphones to get immersed in this incredible escape room game. You'll enjoy this adventure to the fullest! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027740/extras/c72f58e47750c1434a2fd16bbc0bec36.avif?t=1785485073\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027740/extras_big/c72f58e47750c1434a2fd16bbc0bec36.avif?t=1785485073 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >